{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Roxy (Vee)","id":"452613488817209344","is_bot":0,"username":"roxyblack."},"author_id":"452613488817209344","channel_id":"863924328177467413","content":"Wakes up and stretches\nThen stars singing sweetly \n\"Come little children\nI'll take thee away\nInto a land of enchantment\nCome little children\nThe time's come to play\nHere in my garden of shadows\n\nFollow sweet children\nI'll show thee the way\nThrough all the pain\nAnd the sorrows\nWeep not poor children\nFor life is this way\nMurdering beauty and passions\"","created_at":"2021-07-25T20:09:36.121000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868948120157954059","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Roxy (Vee)","id":"452613488817209344","is_bot":0,"username":"roxyblack."},"author_id":"452613488817209344","channel_id":"863924328177467413","content":"\"Hush now dear children\nIt must be this way\nToo weary of life\nAnd deceptions\nRest now my children\nFor soon we'll away\nInto the calm and the quiet\n\nCome little children\nI'll take thee away\nInto a land of enchantment\nCome little children\nThe time's come to play\nHere in my garden of shadows\"","created_at":"2021-07-25T20:10:39.839000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868948387410628669","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Roxy (Vee)","id":"452613488817209344","is_bot":0,"username":"roxyblack."},"author_id":"452613488817209344","channel_id":"863924328177467413","content":"feeling a odd change in the air starts singing a sea song","created_at":"2021-07-26T01:53:23.187000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869034636343382078","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Roxy (Vee)","id":"452613488817209344","is_bot":0,"username":"roxyblack."},"author_id":"452613488817209344","channel_id":"863924328177467413","content":"\"The king and his men\nStole the queen from her bed\nAnd bound her in her bones\nThe seas be ours\nAnd by the powers\nWhere we will, we'll roam\n\nYo, ho, all together\nHoist the colours high\nHeave ho, thieves and beggars\nNever shall we die\n\nYo, ho, haul together\nHoist the colours high\nHeave ho, thieves and beggars\nNever shall we die\n\nSome men have died\nAnd some are alive\nAnd others sail on the sea\n– With the keys to the cage...\nAnd the Devil to pay\nWe lay to Fiddler's Green!\n\nThe bell has been raised\nFrom it's watery grave...\nDo you hear it's sepulchral tone?\nWe are a call to all\nPay head the squall\nAnd turn your sail toward home!\n\nYo, ho, all together\nHoist the colours high\nHeave ho, thieves and beggars\nNever shall we die!\"","created_at":"2021-07-26T01:53:29.743000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869034663841255424","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
